      "title": "Raw objc_msgSend cast and misplaced helper",
      "message": "The helper is defined between the comment that explains the VellumTitlebarToolbar interception and the @interface itself, which separates the comment from the code it describes. The dynamic objc_msgSend call also bypasses compile-time checking, and the cast assumes BOOL has the same ABI size on every architecture. This is generally fine on arm64 and x86_64, but fragile.",
